{
  "id": "giving-short-presentation",
  "title": "提出有根據的活動方案",
  "titleEn": "Presenting a reasoned proposal",
  "category": "校園與合作",
  "level": "中高級",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/giving-short-presentation.webp",
    "alt": "Maya 向同學簡報換書活動提案，展示板用圖像說明圖書館空間、防雨和分成兩組；Ben 站在放有書本與筆記的桌旁。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "At a planning meeting, Maya presents a "
        },
        {
          "text": "proposal",
          "wordIds": [
            "proposal"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " for a book swap that thirty students will attend."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "在規劃會議上，Maya 提出一份方案，要為三十位學生舉辦換書活動。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/giving-short-presentation/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "61d4e17fd205271cf99d01fff7f564e2cca32411e37e143d3c570c9747ffb3b5",
        "sha256": "981c75700473d4289dff67ab8cec360cf7ae4fcc7b96d21eb546e5de802fcf6c"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "We ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "we-recommend-using"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "recommend",
          "phraseIds": [
            "we-recommend-using"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "recommend"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " using",
          "phraseIds": [
            "we-recommend-using"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the library meeting room because it will keep the books dry.”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "「我們建議使用圖書館會議室，因為這樣可以讓書本保持乾燥。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/giving-short-presentation/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "4a94518e93361dd8da76f8762cf089393ebff1e10fa2b431ec9c0fea4521eb88",
        "sha256": "8f9975d1c218d0e3425757a5f8049c23d182e529ea535b1a51aaa5714288d673"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "According to the current notice",
          "phraseIds": [
            "according-to-the-current-notice"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the room is available on Friday.”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "「根據目前的公告，這個房間週五可使用。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/giving-short-presentation/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "88a5c67b53aa7e0b0a59df420a1175511b7877f8166f8150c35e50340f069326",
        "sha256": "e83c1abcd04a7ef9bf077c0f5e4a4b58081b32adfea9078529d042b5c5c84c89"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "The main ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "the-main-advantage-is-that"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "advantage",
          "phraseIds": [
            "the-main-advantage-is-that"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "advantage"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " is that",
          "phraseIds": [
            "the-main-advantage-is-that"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " we won't need to "
        },
        {
          "text": "cancel",
          "wordIds": [
            "cancel"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " if it rains.”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "「主要的好處是，即使下雨，我們也不必取消活動。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/giving-short-presentation/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "5ddecbe8edc1aaf895fddd30f5191202a320f6450059c2f807cbd6fb45899bdf",
        "sha256": "5aef75cd5f900df4b02837b89d815dbe778af2be3540cf707110a76e783bb7c5"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Ben adds, “However, there's a "
        },
        {
          "text": "limit",
          "wordIds": [
            "limit"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " of twenty people, so "
        },
        {
          "text": "we suggest two ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "we-suggest-two-sessions"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sessions",
          "phraseIds": [
            "we-suggest-two-sessions"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "sessions"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " of fifteen",
          "phraseIds": [
            "we-suggest-two-sessions"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Ben 補充：「不過，人數上限是二十人，所以我們建議分成兩場，每場十五人。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/giving-short-presentation/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "aa574745917f5d9d0007eea57209bf3977c48011fe687ab32b1f86921d343a39",
        "sha256": "9b0256c2ddf9486e3852319be04642651736e21867889d38fa9ff98d04b2951d"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "A classmate asks how they will keep the reading area quiet."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "一位同學問，他們要怎麼讓閱覽區保持安靜。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/giving-short-presentation/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "7d057724ec88d2fea97995a31f2d38a0b67656e3396317dba06efe7d22212e1d",
        "sha256": "e8db5397ca0d2c83c2fc23dec0027861106b6997f46e8ebecc85110592cecc09"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“We could close the meeting-room door and ask everyone to keep their voices down,” Maya replies."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Maya 回答：「我們可以關上會議室的門，並請大家放低音量。」",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/giving-short-presentation/7.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "818f405477fe8736ebc4416924b71cede658d8b17ddc31461727b32d14cb4eb1",
        "sha256": "196184af9977814bedaaea46a0ce288db6d652fae973bbac61c35d6f7b22564f"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "Our next step is to",
          "phraseIds": [
            "our-next-step-is-to"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ask the librarian to "
        },
        {
          "text": "reserve",
          "wordIds": [
            "reserve"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the room,” Maya says, and the group agrees."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Maya 說：「我們下一步要請圖書館員協助預約這個房間。」小組成員都表示同意。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/giving-short-presentation/8.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "7932b4a5ddace65913cb939f4ef23a6da42a5e353505aa8e87b3d5a35d2fbae9",
        "sha256": "abe45f9fda6d425636260aa330bd22c9286a495898733298f6d2962ac3743d50"
      }
    }
  ],
